hers for chows. It also helps streamline the hand toward a possible All Simples or Mixed Hand. Discarding T4 might be slightly riskier as it could complete chows for others (T2-T3-T4 or T4-T5-T6), and only 2 left. W3 is a middle tile with 4 left, but it's in the Character suit which others might be collecting based on melds (previous player has W5-W6-W7 meld, across has W5-W6-W7 meld, so W3 might be safer since they are focusing on higher W numbers). However, F1 is still safer as an honor.  \n\nAnswer: Play F1"}
