se Play W8.  \n\nReason: Discarding W8 puts the hand in tenpai waiting for W3, which has 4 copies left, maximizing winning chances. The resulting hand can score at least 8 points through combinations like All Simples, One Voided Suit, Concealed Pung, Single Wait, and either Self-Drawn or Melded Kong.  \n\nAnswer: Play W8"}
